 │ The layout engine                                                                      │
 │                                                                                        │
 │ flatui/layout is the app composition vocabulary. Build a Node tree of Row / Col / Text │
 │ / Spacer, call SolveAndCompose once, and get composed cells plus per-ID rects from the │
 │ same walk — so hit-testing and pixels never drift.                                     │
